"Undertaking By Personal Sureties | California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/jcc-form/CD-140)\nciteturn1678search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; # Undertaking By Personal Sureties (CD-140)Personal sureties use this to tell the court that they will be responsible for paying money or returning property that a court decides (orders) as part of writ of possession.\n\n# Undertaking By Personal Sureties (CD-140)\n\nPersonal sureties use this to tell the court that they will be responsible for paying money or returning property that a court decides (orders) as part of writ of possession. Personal sureties can also use this to tell the court they will be responsible for paying money the court decides (orders) must be paid as part of an attachment .\n\nGet form CD-140\n\nEffective: January 1, 2006--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAT-160/CD-140 Undertaking By Personal Sureties (Attachment and Claim And Delivery) (https://courts.ca.gov/sites/default/files/courts/default/2024-11/cd140.pdf)\nciteturn1678search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.4 years ago; Crawled: last year; AT-160/CD-140 ... www.courtinfo.ca.gov\nAT-160/CD-140\n\nATTORNEY OR PARTY WITHOUT ATTORNEY (Name, State Bar number, and address):\n\nTELEPHONE NO.:  \nFAX NO. (Optional):  \nE-MAIL ADDRESS (Optional):  \nATTORNEY FOR (Name):\n\nSUPERIOR COURT OF CALIFORNIA, COUNTY OF\n\nSTREET ADDRESS:  \nMAILING ADDRESS:  \nCITY AND ZIP CODE:  \nBRANCH NAME:\n\nPLAINTIFF:  \nDEFENDANT:\n\nFOR COURT USE ONLY\n\nCASE NUMBER:\n\n[ ] Plaintiff's   [ ] Defendant's   UNDERTAKING BY PERSONAL SURETIES   [ ] Attachment   [ ] Claim and Delivery\n\n1. [ ] Plaintiff (name):  \n2. [ ] Defendant (name):  \n3. Amount of undertaking: $  \n4. [ ] (Claim and delivery only) Address to which notice of objection to sureties may be sent (specify):\n\n5. This undertaking is for [ ] attachment. [ ] claim and delivery.  \n6. We, the undersigned sureties, hereby submit to the jurisdiction of the court in all matters affecting our liability on this undertaking and obligate ourselves, jointly and severally, to and including the amount specified in item 3,\n\nATTACHMENT\n\na. [ ] to pay the defendant named in item 2 any amount the defendant may recover for any wrongful attachment by the plaintiff named in item 1 in the action under Code of Civil Procedure section 489.210.  \nb. [ ] to pay the plaintiff named in item 1 the value of the property released not exceeding the amount of any judgment which may be recovered by the plaintiff in an action against the defendant named in item 2 (Code Civ. Proc., § 489.310).  \nc. [ ] to pay the plaintiff named in item 1 the amount of any judgment that may be recovered by the plaintiff in the action against the defendant named in item 2 under Code of Civil Procedure section 489.320.\n\nCLAIM AND DELIVERY\n\nd. [ ] to the plaintiff named in item 1, if the plaintiff recover judgment in the action, the defendant named in item 2 will pay all costs awarded to the plaintiff and all damages that the plaintiff may sustain by reason of the loss of the property, not exceeding the amount of this undertaking under Code of Civil Procedure section 515.020.  \ne. [ ] to the defendant named in item 1, for the return of the property to the defendant if a return is ordered, and for the payment of any sum the defendant may recover against the plaintiff, not exceeding the amount of this undertaking under Code of Civil Procedure section 515.010.\n\n7. a. (1) Surety (name):  \n   (2) Occupation:  \n   Residence address:  \n   Business address:  \n   Address for service:\n\n   b. (1) Surety (name):  \n   (2) Occupation:  \n   Residence address:  \n   Business address:  \n   Address for service:\n\nPage 1 of 2\n\nForm Adopted for Mandatory Use  \nJudicial Council of California  \nAT-160/CD-140 [Rev. January 1, 2006]\n\nUNDERTAKING BY PERSONAL SURETIES  \n(Attachment and Claim and Delivery)\n\nCode Civ. Proc., §§ 482.030, 515.010, 515.020,  \n995.510, 995.520  \nwww.courtinfo.ca.gov--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=2&query=RT-)\nciteturn1678search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # Find Your Court Forms ...   * CD-140 * Undertaking By Personal Sureties Effective: January 1, 2006\n\n# Find Your Court Forms\n\nSearch for any topic or form number, view all forms or view all forms by category\n\nwarning alert banner:\n\n### Don't fill forms in your browser!\n\nUse Adobe Reader. See instructions.\n\nFound 1353 forms matching \"RT-\".\n\nForms marked with the asterisk (\"*\") are adopted for mandatory use by all courts.\n\n  * CD-130 * Writ of Possession Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CD-140 * Undertaking By Personal Sureties Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CD-160 * Application and Notice of Application and Hearing for Order to Quash Ex Parte Writ of Possession Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CD-170 * Order for Release and Redelivery of Property Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CD-180 * Declaration for Ex Parte Writ of Possession Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CD-190 * Application for Temporary Restraining Order Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CD-200 * Temporary Restraining Order Effective: January 1, 2006\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CH-109 * Notice of Court Hearing Effective: January 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español Tiếng Việt\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * CH-110 * Temporary Restraining Order (CLETS-TCH) Effective: January 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español Tiếng Việt\n\nSee form info Download\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=4&query=AT-)\nciteturn1678search2 [